          "short": "$5\\text{ cm}^2$",
          "worked": "Length ratio, larger : smaller: $16:4=4:1$.\n\nArea ratio: $4^2:1^2=16:1$.\n\nThe ratio table scales $16:1$ to $80:5$.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x}{80}&=\\left(\\frac{4}{16}\\right)^2\\\\x&=80\\times\\frac1{16}\\\\x&=5\\text{ cm}^2\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
