              "description": "Similar unshaded rectangles, smaller upper left and larger lower right. Side labels retain a-to-c and b-to-d correspondence. No numerical lengths are added.",
              "mathematics": "ab=24 and cd=150; c/a=d/b=5/2. The task asks for possible integer dimensions rather than measurements from the drawing.",
